    "name": "gotitinc/aha-react",
    "descriptionZh": "已归档的 Aha Design System React 组件库。用法是同时装 @ahaui/react 与 @ahaui/css，再用 AssetPlugin 之类的插件替换 Logo、Avatar、EmptyState 里的资源。",
    "takeawayZh": "读归档仓库，抄 Button 这类组件的插件化定制写法。",
    "noteZh": "进站先看到一条黄条：「This repository was archived by the owner on Oct 19, 2023. It is now read-only.」，仓库名旁挂着 Public archive 徽标。README 的 Usage 示例就是 <Button onClick={onButtonClick}>Click me!</Button>，Customization 一节讲用 AssetPlugin 给 Logo、Avatar、EmptyState 换自定义资源；About 标签是 aha、design-system、hacktoberfest、react-components，Apache-2.0 license，语言栏 JavaScript 100%，117 次提交后停更。",
